{# PROPOSAL -- for C1 to place in templates/macros. NOT active. NOT loaded by any render harness. #}
{# audit_ref: codex-manager-current-source-audits-20260923-0315 (F_representation_audit item 5) #}
{# target: .github/changelog-configuration.json (quasi-JSON; trailing-comma/space quirks) #}
{# tested: true -- render-parity vs a3352b2 (415B); see PROPOSAL-index.yaml render_parity_evidence #}
{#
   changelog-configuration.json is NOT valid JSON (trailing comma after the last element,
   trailing spaces on the first and pr_template lines), so a strict serializer cannot
   reproduce it. All format literals are sourced from the schema. Two bug-classes the
   audit cares about are handled explicitly:
     - trailing-comma quirk: the boolean fmt.trailing_comma_after_last is CONSUMED by a
       conditional (not hardcoded structure); when true, a comma follows every element.
     - pr_template trailing space: the boolean fmt.pr_template_trailing_space is CONSUMED
       by a conditional that emits fmt.space_char (booleans are never printed directly).
     - '{{' re-templating: token braces are ASSEMBLED inside the macro by emitting
       fmt.open_brace_char / fmt.close_brace_char twice, so DATA never contains '{{'
       (include_vars would re-template that). Token NAMES come from `tokens` (the manifest
       already stores CHANGELOG / TITLE / AUTHOR / NUMBER with no braces).

   params -> declared schema keys (emitted-structural-literals-schema.yaml):
     categories -> changelog manifest values (each {title, labels}; data)
     keys       -> changelog_keys.{categories,title,labels,template,pr_template} (data)
     tokens     -> {changelog,title,author,number} token NAMES (data; no braces)
     fmt        -> changelog_layout.* + changelog_json_punctuation.* + changelog_token_assembly.*
                   + render_options.newline_sequence
                   + fmt.labels_separators <- json_render.changelog_labels.separators
                   + fmt.labels_ensure_ascii <- json_render.changelog_labels.ensure_ascii
                   (labels use to_json with EXPLICIT separators/ensure_ascii -- no filter default)
   No parameter has a default. Terminal newline is OWNED by this macro (final line_terminator).
#}
{% macro render_declared_layout_object(categories, keys, tokens, fmt) -%}
{{ fmt.open_line }}{{ fmt.line_terminator }}
{{- fmt.indent_l1 }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{{ keys.categories }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{{ fmt.colon }}{{ fmt.array_open }}{{ fmt.line_terminator }}
{%- for c in categories %}
{{- fmt.indent_l2 }}{{ fmt.obj_open }}{{ fmt.line_terminator }}
{{- fmt.indent_l3 }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{{ keys.title }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{{ fmt.colon }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{{ c.title }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{% if fmt.trailing_comma_after_last %}{{ fmt.comma }}{% endif %}{{ fmt.line_terminator }}
{{- fmt.indent_l3 }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{{ keys.labels }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{{ fmt.colon }}{{ c.labels | to_json(separators=fmt.labels_separators, ensure_ascii=fmt.labels_ensure_ascii) }}{% if fmt.trailing_comma_after_last %}{{ fmt.comma }}{% endif %}{{ fmt.line_terminator }}
{{- fmt.indent_l2 }}{{ fmt.obj_close }}{% if fmt.trailing_comma_after_last %}{{ fmt.comma }}{% endif %}{{ fmt.line_terminator }}
{%- endfor %}
{{- fmt.indent_l1 }}{{ fmt.array_close }}{% if fmt.trailing_comma_after_last %}{{ fmt.comma }}{% endif %}{{ fmt.line_terminator }}
{{- fmt.indent_l1 }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{{ keys.template }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{{ fmt.colon }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{{ fmt.token_prefix }}{{ fmt.open_brace_char }}{{ fmt.open_brace_char }}{{ tokens.changelog }}{{ fmt.close_brace_char }}{{ fmt.close_brace_char }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{% if fmt.trailing_comma_after_last %}{{ fmt.comma }}{% endif %}{{ fmt.line_terminator }}
{{- fmt.indent_l1 }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{{ keys.pr_template }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{{ fmt.colon }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{{ fmt.pr_lead }}{{ fmt.token_prefix }}{{ fmt.open_brace_char }}{{ fmt.open_brace_char }}{{ tokens.title }}{{ fmt.close_brace_char }}{{ fmt.close_brace_char }}{{ fmt.pr_conn_author }}{{ fmt.token_prefix }}{{ fmt.open_brace_char }}{{ fmt.open_brace_char }}{{ tokens.author }}{{ fmt.close_brace_char }}{{ fmt.close_brace_char }}{{ fmt.pr_conn_number }}{{ fmt.token_prefix }}{{ fmt.open_brace_char }}{{ fmt.open_brace_char }}{{ tokens.number }}{{ fmt.close_brace_char }}{{ fmt.close_brace_char }}{{ fmt.key_quote }}{% if fmt.pr_template_trailing_space %}{{ fmt.space_char }}{% endif %}{{ fmt.line_terminator }}
{{- fmt.close_char }}{{ fmt.line_terminator }}
{%- endmacro %}
